1
00:00:11,798 --> 00:00:13,112
<i>I like you.</i>

2
00:00:14,997 --> 00:00:16,897
Will you go out with me?

3
00:00:24,935 --> 00:00:26,974
Well...

4
00:00:35,769 --> 00:00:37,597
I...

5
00:00:41,070 --> 00:00:46,508
I want to think it over
before I give you my answer.

6
00:00:49,404 --> 00:00:51,221
So...

7
00:00:53,059 --> 00:00:57,301
could you give me some time to think?

8
00:01:09,738 --> 00:01:11,045
Okay.

9
00:01:15,204 --> 00:01:16,904
What should I do?

10
00:02:10,533 --> 00:02:12,246
Ms. Yamane.

11
00:02:12,246 --> 00:02:13,292
Yes?

12
00:02:13,292 --> 00:02:15,783
Documents for the field test.

13
00:02:15,783 --> 00:02:18,180
Someone from the parent company
is coming,

14
00:02:18,180 --> 00:02:19,646
so I did them quickly.

15
00:02:19,646 --> 00:02:21,628
Thank you so much.

16
00:02:23,091 --> 00:02:27,059
Hey, I need to talk to you.

17
00:02:27,059 --> 00:02:28,830
Yes, what is it?

18
00:02:29,576 --> 00:02:32,875
Are you free tonight?

19
00:02:35,216 --> 00:02:38,391
I never imagined you'd ask me out,
Ms. Ohata.

20
00:02:38,391 --> 00:02:41,101
And to such a lovely restaurant too.

21
00:02:43,032 --> 00:02:44,800
Here is your wine.

22
00:02:50,718 --> 00:02:54,231
<i>I want to bring you here every day.</i>

23
00:02:55,226 --> 00:02:57,524
Then we need to speak with the vendor.

24
00:02:57,524 --> 00:03:00,213
<i>I want my team to rely on me,</i>

25
00:03:00,213 --> 00:03:03,092
<i>even though I might be overbearing.</i>

26
00:03:03,092 --> 00:03:04,726
Want me to help?

27
00:03:04,726 --> 00:03:06,121
<i>Ms. Yamane is...</i>

28
00:03:06,121 --> 00:03:09,611
No, I'll do my best. Thank you.

29
00:03:09,611 --> 00:03:11,993
Does she think I'm unreliable?

30
00:03:13,148 --> 00:03:16,179
I think she's just being considerate.

31
00:03:16,918 --> 00:03:19,374
I hope so.

32
00:03:19,374 --> 00:03:23,732
<i>I've noticed she's been
acting strange lately.</i>

33
00:03:23,732 --> 00:03:25,202
Ms. Yamane?

34
00:03:26,415 --> 00:03:31,211
Thank you for your concern.
But I'll do my best.

35
00:03:35,663 --> 00:03:38,340
<i>I see.</i>

36
00:03:38,340 --> 00:03:39,993
That's tough.

37
00:03:41,375 --> 00:03:45,819
<i>Honestly, Ms. Yamane is just so...</i>

38
00:03:47,457 --> 00:03:52,167
<i>so cute and easy to read!</i>

39
00:03:53,771 --> 00:03:58,997
So... why did you invite me out today?

40
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:04,917
You always work so hard, Ms. Yamane.

41
00:04:06,589 --> 00:04:08,188
But lately...

42
00:04:09,106 --> 00:04:11,797
you seem troubled about something.

43
00:04:20,310 --> 00:04:22,339
Like with Taguchi.

44
00:04:24,860 --> 00:04:27,167
Huh? H-How...

45
00:04:28,101 --> 00:04:30,630
Well, that's...

46
00:04:31,316 --> 00:04:33,425
I could tell just by looking.

47
00:04:35,923 --> 00:04:40,275
But... even if it's not about that,

48
00:04:40,275 --> 00:04:43,284
I just want to be there for you.

49
00:04:43,284 --> 00:04:45,509
That's just how I am as a boss.

50
00:04:47,926 --> 00:04:49,993
You can tell me anything.

51
00:04:54,147 --> 00:04:56,398
Well, actually...

52
00:04:57,763 --> 00:05:02,638
He told me that he likes me.

53
00:05:03,819 --> 00:05:05,039
Huh?

54
00:05:06,181 --> 00:05:07,181
Huh?

55
00:05:08,007 --> 00:05:10,386
You two weren't dating?

56
00:05:10,386 --> 00:05:14,773
Huh? N-No, we weren't!

57
00:05:14,773 --> 00:05:17,818
So... Huh?

58
00:05:17,818 --> 00:05:21,264
Let's start off with a drink.

59
00:05:21,264 --> 00:05:22,915
The night is young.

60
00:05:24,513 --> 00:05:25,708
Ms. Yamane.

61
00:05:25,708 --> 00:05:27,075
Thank you.

62
00:05:30,904 --> 00:05:36,071
He was a really important person to me.

63
00:05:36,071 --> 00:05:39,987
My one and only friend.

64
00:05:43,662 --> 00:05:46,755
Oh, it's all gone.

65
00:05:49,631 --> 00:05:51,184
Back then,

66
00:05:51,184 --> 00:05:55,838
you didn't have
any romantic feelings for Taguchi?

67
00:05:58,256 --> 00:06:04,555
I've honestly never had
any experience of romance.

68
00:06:06,187 --> 00:06:11,765
And what if our relationship changes...

69
00:06:15,789 --> 00:06:18,788
and things don't go well?

70
00:06:22,698 --> 00:06:24,660
Don't talk to me anymore.

71
00:06:34,441 --> 00:06:36,860
Drifting apart again would be...

72
00:06:39,251 --> 00:06:40,626
I don't want that.

73
00:06:46,731 --> 00:06:48,674
Sorry for the rambling.

74
00:06:51,674 --> 00:06:54,997
So... that's your concern?

75
00:06:57,280 --> 00:06:58,894
Huh?

76
00:06:58,894 --> 00:07:00,090
Well,

77
00:07:00,774 --> 00:07:04,720
breaking up is something that can happen
after you start dating, right?

78
00:07:05,333 --> 00:07:10,388
So you're open... to the actual dating part?

79
00:07:17,091 --> 00:07:18,776
You're right.

80
00:07:19,888 --> 00:07:23,332
Wait, but...

81
00:07:23,332 --> 00:07:25,533
But...

82
00:07:25,533 --> 00:07:27,039
- Huh?
- <i>Oh?</i>

83
00:07:27,039 --> 00:07:28,140
That's...

84
00:07:28,140 --> 00:07:29,715
Ms. Yamane.

85
00:07:30,801 --> 00:07:34,382
Let's ask Taguchi out on a date.

86
00:07:34,382 --> 00:07:36,522
- Huh? A date?
- Yeah.

87
00:07:36,522 --> 00:07:40,163
And try holding his hand while you're at it.

88
00:07:40,163 --> 00:07:41,211
But we're not official!

89
00:07:41,211 --> 00:07:43,077
It's fine. It's a date.

90
00:07:43,967 --> 00:07:45,273
What?

91
00:07:46,174 --> 00:07:47,820
[Meigakusha]

92
00:07:47,820 --> 00:07:49,485
Need something?

93
00:07:52,567 --> 00:07:54,032
Well...

94
00:07:55,678 --> 00:07:57,076
Yeah?

95
00:08:03,223 --> 00:08:04,834
Well...

96
00:08:15,002 --> 00:08:16,458
I'm...

97
00:08:19,456 --> 00:08:21,642
I'm kinda sorry for causing you trouble.

98
00:08:22,825 --> 00:08:23,978
Huh?

99
00:08:25,649 --> 00:08:27,148
The thing I said.

100
00:08:37,434 --> 00:08:39,316
If it's too much for you,

101
00:08:40,649 --> 00:08:43,080
we can just stay friends like before.

102
00:08:48,558 --> 00:08:50,659
Taguchi...

103
00:08:52,244 --> 00:08:53,966
Is that really okay?

104
00:08:56,161 --> 00:08:57,384
It's okay.

105
00:08:59,339 --> 00:09:00,591
But...

106
00:09:06,882 --> 00:09:08,897
it wouldn't be ideal.

107
00:09:14,006 --> 00:09:16,560
I want to spend more time with you.

108
00:09:18,889 --> 00:09:20,898
I want to get closer to you.

109
00:09:27,205 --> 00:09:28,906
But, you know...

110
00:09:32,990 --> 00:09:35,779
Those are my feelings, not yours.

111
00:09:47,796 --> 00:09:49,171
Will you...

112
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:57,446
go on a date with me?

113
00:10:02,307 --> 00:10:03,702
Really?

114
00:10:07,217 --> 00:10:08,441
Yeah.

115
00:10:12,238 --> 00:10:14,343
A date? I'm jealous.

116
00:10:14,343 --> 00:10:16,474
What do I do? My heart is...

117
00:10:16,474 --> 00:10:17,808
Hey, careful!

118
00:10:17,808 --> 00:10:19,969
Oh, sorry.

119
00:10:23,112 --> 00:10:27,236
Hey, are you gonna be okay
going out like this?

120
00:10:27,236 --> 00:10:30,703
Oh, want me to press a pressure point
to calm you down?

121
00:10:35,010 --> 00:10:38,311
Taguchi means a lot to me, but...

122
00:10:39,642 --> 00:10:44,732
I still can't tell
if it's romance or just friendship.

123
00:10:47,998 --> 00:10:50,095
What do you think, Nagi?

124
00:10:53,069 --> 00:10:54,821
I don't think it is.

125
00:10:57,441 --> 00:11:00,092
Not that my opinion would change anything.

126
00:11:05,499 --> 00:11:09,808
The only one who can
put a name to that "love" is you.

127
00:11:18,679 --> 00:11:21,022
There. All done.

128
00:11:22,349 --> 00:11:24,672
Wow, that's cute.

129
00:11:27,107 --> 00:11:28,439
Nagi.

130
00:11:30,557 --> 00:11:32,544
Thank you.

131
00:11:32,544 --> 00:11:34,001
No problem.

132
00:11:43,527 --> 00:11:46,139
Sorry for making you wait.

133
00:11:46,999 --> 00:11:48,390
Your hair...

134
00:11:49,467 --> 00:11:52,629
Oh, my brother styled it for me.

135
00:11:52,629 --> 00:11:54,193
It's not just your hair.

136
00:11:54,965 --> 00:11:57,362
You look really cute today.

137
00:11:57,362 --> 00:11:58,901
Beautiful, actually.

138
00:11:59,900 --> 00:12:01,737
Thank you.

139
00:12:03,922 --> 00:12:05,362
Well, then...

140
00:12:06,440 --> 00:12:08,042
Shall we head out?

141
00:12:08,042 --> 00:12:09,161
Yeah.

142
00:12:13,263 --> 00:12:16,502
We're going to
a Japanese paper workshop today.

143
00:12:25,207 --> 00:12:27,481
- This is incredible.
- Yeah.

144
00:12:29,958 --> 00:12:33,066
- Then you shake it like this.
- Like this?

145
00:12:33,066 --> 00:12:35,889
- Put some feeling into it.
- Okay.

146
00:12:35,889 --> 00:12:36,935
That's heavy!

147
00:12:36,935 --> 00:12:39,346
Yeah, it slowly gets heavier.

148
00:12:39,346 --> 00:12:41,212
- Is this right?
- You got it.

149
00:12:45,619 --> 00:12:47,395
- That's cute.
- Right?

150
00:12:49,002 --> 00:12:51,637
- You chose blue.
- Yeah.

151
00:12:51,637 --> 00:12:53,071
It's Santa.

152
00:12:53,071 --> 00:12:54,341
So adorable.

153
00:12:54,341 --> 00:12:55,769
That's what we did earlier.

154
00:12:55,769 --> 00:12:57,126
Yeah.

155
00:12:58,704 --> 00:13:01,019
This bookmark is cute too.

156
00:13:01,019 --> 00:13:02,381
Shiori...
("Shiori" means "bookmark")

157
00:13:06,709 --> 00:13:08,656
Let's eat.

158
00:13:16,392 --> 00:13:18,252
Oh! It's delicious!

159
00:13:18,252 --> 00:13:20,645
- Really?
- Yeah.

160
00:13:20,645 --> 00:13:22,775
Do you want to try some?

161
00:13:22,775 --> 00:13:25,821
Can I? Let me have a bite then.

162
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:28,615
Here you go.

163
00:13:31,895 --> 00:13:35,277
Nothing. It just reminded me
of what happened before.

164
00:13:39,973 --> 00:13:42,379
Food tastes better when I'm with you.

165
00:13:47,345 --> 00:13:48,911
Can I try some?

166
00:13:48,911 --> 00:13:50,080
Sure.

167
00:13:55,292 --> 00:13:57,770
We ended up in a nook again, huh?

168
00:13:59,049 --> 00:14:00,649
Sorry about that.

169
00:14:00,649 --> 00:14:01,899
What?

170
00:14:06,629 --> 00:14:10,483
Food tastes better
when you eat with other people, huh?

171
00:14:10,483 --> 00:14:12,784
Nah, that wouldn't change the taste.

172
00:14:16,317 --> 00:14:18,652
Here, you can have this.

173
00:14:18,652 --> 00:14:21,293
Hey, stop trying to prove your point.

174
00:14:29,995 --> 00:14:32,457
What's important is "who" you eat with.

175
00:14:35,056 --> 00:14:36,630
I see.

176
00:14:37,302 --> 00:14:40,395
So it tastes good
because I'm eating with you.

177
00:14:49,413 --> 00:14:50,867
Give me a bite.

178
00:14:50,867 --> 00:14:53,173
Oh, okay.

179
00:14:53,173 --> 00:14:56,813
- Here.
- Quit offering it like a tribute.

180
00:15:00,006 --> 00:15:01,113
Hurry, hurry!

181
00:15:01,113 --> 00:15:02,426
What do you want to eat?

182
00:15:02,426 --> 00:15:03,453
I want cotton candy.

183
00:15:03,453 --> 00:15:05,213
Is it over there?

184
00:15:31,590 --> 00:15:32,865
Sorry.

185
00:15:37,490 --> 00:15:39,626
I don't want you tripping again.

186
00:15:43,227 --> 00:15:45,544
What? Feeling nervous?

187
00:15:46,490 --> 00:15:48,037
I'm not.

188
00:15:50,271 --> 00:15:51,633
I see.

189
00:15:56,542 --> 00:15:58,916
Go down this road and turn right.

190
00:15:58,916 --> 00:16:01,095
- Okay.
- It should be over there.

191
00:16:01,095 --> 00:16:02,777
- Thank you!
- Thank you so much!

192
00:16:02,777 --> 00:16:04,715
- That's great.
- Yeah.

193
00:16:04,715 --> 00:16:08,723
By the way, are you here alone today?

194
00:16:08,723 --> 00:16:10,423
I'm waiting for someone.

195
00:16:10,423 --> 00:16:13,697
Oh, can I at least get your contact info?

196
00:16:13,697 --> 00:16:14,983
Is that okay?

197
00:16:14,983 --> 00:16:17,047
I'm really sorry.

198
00:16:17,047 --> 00:16:18,953
But if you'd like...

199
00:16:25,403 --> 00:16:27,590
I'm on a date.

200
00:16:27,590 --> 00:16:28,683
Oh.

201
00:16:28,683 --> 00:16:31,318
Sorry for bothering you.

202
00:16:31,318 --> 00:16:32,967
Let's go.

203
00:16:40,597 --> 00:16:42,226
You're not letting go?

204
00:16:45,097 --> 00:16:46,987
If we hold hands like this,

205
00:16:48,047 --> 00:16:51,885
people won't come up to you again, right?

206
00:17:04,484 --> 00:17:08,819
Yamane, you were totally nervous today,
weren't you?

207
00:17:11,657 --> 00:17:14,239
Yeah. I really was.

208
00:17:19,082 --> 00:17:20,460
Me too.

209
00:17:21,781 --> 00:17:24,810
My heart was pounding so hard back then.

210
00:17:30,268 --> 00:17:32,566
When we held hands at the festival.

211
00:17:44,270 --> 00:17:45,717
I've...

212
00:17:47,979 --> 00:17:50,149
always been shy.

213
00:17:52,001 --> 00:17:54,343
When I was little,

214
00:17:54,343 --> 00:17:58,469
I was always hiding behind my brother.

215
00:18:04,437 --> 00:18:07,431
Back in elementary school,

216
00:18:07,431 --> 00:18:10,844
I got invited to a friend's birthday party.

217
00:18:13,177 --> 00:18:17,323
They said "everyone's invited", but...

218
00:18:19,569 --> 00:18:22,326
there was one kid who wasn't invited.

219
00:18:26,523 --> 00:18:31,622
I probably should've rejected her invitation.

220
00:18:32,361 --> 00:18:36,584
<i>♪ Happy birthday dear Haruka ♪</i>

221
00:18:36,584 --> 00:18:39,751
<i>♪ Happy birthday to you ♪</i>

222
00:18:39,751 --> 00:18:42,858
Happy birthday!

223
00:18:46,186 --> 00:18:54,346
Since then, making new friends scared me.

224
00:18:56,423 --> 00:18:58,670
Even when I entered high school,

225
00:18:59,768 --> 00:19:03,033
I was so anxious.

226
00:19:11,323 --> 00:19:15,533
And that's when I met you.

227
00:19:18,909 --> 00:19:21,969
I was so happy

228
00:19:23,637 --> 00:19:25,657
to become friends with you.

229
00:19:29,606 --> 00:19:31,061
I was happy too.

230
00:19:47,533 --> 00:19:49,204
Should we get going?

231
00:20:02,619 --> 00:20:04,169
I was...

232
00:20:05,789 --> 00:20:08,115
I was scared this whole time.

233
00:20:11,253 --> 00:20:13,609
If our relationship changes...

234
00:20:15,048 --> 00:20:16,629
What if...

235
00:20:17,886 --> 00:20:20,919
What if it falls apart?

236
00:20:22,972 --> 00:20:28,511
I feel like we can't even
go back to being friends this time.

237
00:20:39,198 --> 00:20:40,370
Yeah.

238
00:20:44,719 --> 00:20:46,750
Even so...

239
00:20:48,827 --> 00:20:51,492
I want to keep holding your hand.

240
00:20:59,927 --> 00:21:05,212
The joy of being together,

241
00:21:06,786 --> 00:21:10,065
the fear of being apart,

242
00:21:11,313 --> 00:21:13,625
and even the frustration...

243
00:21:19,367 --> 00:21:22,714
I want to say that all of it is love.

244
00:21:28,026 --> 00:21:30,301
Taguchi...

245
00:21:32,918 --> 00:21:34,481
I like you.

246
00:21:36,114 --> 00:21:40,624
So, if you feel the same,

247
00:21:43,888 --> 00:21:46,075
please go out with me.

248
00:22:01,498 --> 00:22:03,191
Are you sure?

249
00:22:07,549 --> 00:22:08,745
Yeah.

250
00:22:57,495 --> 00:23:00,312
I feel like I'm dying.

251
00:23:01,398 --> 00:23:06,510
Please go easy on me.

252
00:23:06,510 --> 00:23:09,734
No way. I can't.

253
00:23:09,734 --> 00:23:12,323
<i>You always felt out of reach,</i>

254
00:23:13,873 --> 00:23:18,246
<i>and I was content just being by your side.</i>

255
00:23:19,132 --> 00:23:22,747
I'm going that way. See you at school.

256
00:23:22,747 --> 00:23:23,834
Okay.

257
00:23:24,821 --> 00:23:26,183
Bye.

258
00:23:29,183 --> 00:23:30,494
<i>But...</i>

259
00:23:33,361 --> 00:23:34,929
<i>From now on...</i>

260
00:23:45,551 --> 00:23:48,001
I can't calm down around her.

261
00:23:48,001 --> 00:23:49,893
An office romance...

262
00:23:49,893 --> 00:23:51,860
Tell me all about your romance.

263
00:23:51,860 --> 00:23:53,364
Did you share the truth?

264
00:23:53,364 --> 00:23:55,100
I don't want to upset you.

265
00:23:55,100 --> 00:23:57,437
I want to know more about Taguchi.

266
00:23:57,437 --> 00:23:58,832
Yamane?
